{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:74fc304be546d799","name":"Hidden Core","source":{"id":"source:reference-74fc304be546d799","title":"Hidden Core","revision":21046,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:03:37Z","sha256":"e55bb29bd33557a1039e96a91d3c978a847158476f41555ea0ad12468637034d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21046","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hidden%20Core&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-74fc304be546d799","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram (when using a secondary data store) or N/A (when concealed in the Droid's main ",{"tag":"a","children":["Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Processor"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," has a concealed back-up copy of its personality and the data, skills, and memories it regards as critical to its mission or operation. The copy can be concealed within the Droid's main ",{"tag":"a","children":["Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Processor"}," or be installed as a hidden secondary data store elsewhere within the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". The backup restores itself 1d6 days after a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Memory Wipe"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Memory_Wipe"}," with a successful DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check (roll 1d20 + 10, or 1d20 + the Droid's current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill modifier, whichever is greater). If unsuccessful, the Hidden Core tries to restore itself again every 1d6 days.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Discovering a Hidden Core requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check against the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". The character making the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check must state that he or she is looking for a Hidden Core or for anything suspicious. For double the standard cost of a Hidden Core (for a cost of 400), the Hidden Core's installer can automatically provide a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of 30 for this check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
